<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8392"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jed4258<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jed4258<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 1:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nugzter - I&#39;d be interested, being a retiree from the AF, it would be somewhat of an insult if BTK had been AF.  I do have a limited amount of resources that I could check the name against though.  I&#39;ll email you later this evening, unless you post it in the meanwhile.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
