</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 2:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->look what I found. <BR> <BR>retired postal worker. 31 years. Where is ROSE HILL? <BR> <BR>he said something like smelling the flowers makes his day????? in one of his posts. <BR> <BR>link <BR> <BR><a href="http://skyways.lib.ks.us/museums/kng/goetzhf.html" target=_top>http://skyways.lib.ks.us/museums/kng/goetzhf.html</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
