<!--Post: 8405--><!--Time: 1109113738-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8405"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:nugzter@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 3:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I derved my country too. But this is an investigation. Every one who can not be cleared is open to being looked into.His Birth year fits, and if you read other theorys here and other places, you will see it could fit. 31 years post office. Has access to names and addresses. Possably even the neighborhoods at one time when he was starting out. Delivery man. <BR>Probably in a positon of control at his job. Could have known Otero. <BR>See my theory about last names and victims in theorys. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
