</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 5:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sorry Nugz, I didn&#39;t mean to upset you, the other posts are filled wite peoples names who are either under investigation or have been and their info, is public knowledge. I guess I just wouldn&#39;t want Tom to get in trouble for letting us go off the deep end and add personal details about normal people. I hope your not mad. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
