<!--Post: 8567--><!--Time: 1109210476-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8567"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dpinva<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dpinva<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 6:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><b>&#34;NOBODY is saying the guy is BTK. He meets some criteria and that&#39;s why he mentioned it.... to discuss it.......  <BR> <BR>Nothing else.  <BR> <BR>Hello! &#34;</b> <BR> <BR>Then let&#39;s stop running this guys name through the mud and wasting time and board space. This site is about possible <b>BTK suspects</b>, not every single person who MIGHT be someone who is a little strange to someone - <b><i>get a grip folks!</i></b> &#40;I guess I need to start a new website - completelyuselessinformationabouteveryone.com&#41; <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
